---
pre-compare: sort
---

// Synthetic PAN-OS Authentication records; every value is invented. The column
// order follows the PAN-OS 11.1 Authentication log fields.
// https://docs.paloaltonetworks.com/ngfw/administration/monitoring/use-syslog-for-monitoring/syslog-field-descriptions/authentication-log-fields
// A successful first factor, a failed second factor of the same
// authentication, and a timeout without user. The missing user of the timeout
// stays missing.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_lines
}
this = line.parse_syslog()
paloalto::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
drop raw_data, raw_data_size
drop_null_fields
